      "releaseNotes": "Version 3.11.0 - What’s New\n\nNew: We've streamlined the login experience for U-Haul Business Account customers.\n\nImproved: The Orders tab now shows more order history with enhanced filtering.\n\nAdded: You can now back up content saved in the My Belongings Organizer® tool with cloud support\n\nFixed: Minor bug fixes and improvements",
      "version": "3.11.0",
      "wrapperType": "software",
      "currency": "USD",
      "description": "Get Moving Faster with the U-Haul app. Wherever you’re headed, our app is designed for Moving Made Easier®. Get an instant quote, start or modify your reservation, track your orders, and so much more, all from your mobile device. It’s the fastest and most secure way to manage your move!\n\n- Pick up and return your rental with just a few taps on your device, any time.\n- Sign in with your custom profile to skip the counter and reserve in minutes.\n- Get an instant quote, manage your order, and review your rental history.\n- Use the live chat feature or email us for 24/7 support.\n- View FAQs and resources to answer your questions. \n- Quickly find a U-Haul location near you with the products and services you need.",
